1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Antonio (Rodriguez ) known as Roiz and Leonora Roiz lived as marranos (crypto-Jews) in Portugal and concealed their Jewish identity from the authorities. Their son, Diego, added to his family name the title Maduro,
2 CONC  which means mature or senior. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1477, Ferdinand (whose great-grandmother was Jewish) and Isabella petitioned the Pope for the right to establish an Inquisition.The idea was to punish those who were practicing their Judaism while calling themselves Catholic.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1492 every Jew had left Spain the majority crossed the border and went to Portugal, also the Rodrigues ancesor of Antonio Roiz, 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://dcodriscoll.pbworks.com/Peixotto
2 CONT
