1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Antonio Roiz o Maduro, was sentenced to be burned to death by the Inquisition in Portugal for "crimes against the Catholic faith and for observance of the laws of Moses." He was burned alive at the stake in the cen
2 CONC tral square of the Portuguese city of Coimbra.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Antonio's converso surname was "Roiz." We don't know what his Hebrew given name was.
2 CONT
2 CONT See http://seroesdabeira.webs.com/noticias.htm (in Portuguese) about the importance of Trancoso as a Jewish town.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
