2 CONT 1.2.1 Antonio Roiz o Maduro d'Alcunha; b. 1570, Trancoso, Portugal; burned at the stake 28 Aug 1616 in an auto-da-fe at Coimbra, Portugal; his wife and his four children managed to escape to St Jean de Luz, France.
