1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alcalde de Almaden 1588, named by Carvajal, and first Alcalde of Monterrey 1604
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Juan de FARIAS was born (date unknown).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria de TREVIÑO. Maria de TREVIÑO and Juan de FARIAS74 were married about 1575. Children were: Juliana de QUINTANILLA, Sebastiana Quintanilla TREVIÑO, Capt. Juan de FARIAS, 2nd Lt. Alonso de FARIAS, _______ TREVIÑO, Marti
2 CONC n SANCHEZ.
