2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT IRUELA, LUIS ROMERA, and Ma. del CARMEN GALBIS DIEZ. '''Catalogo de Pasajeros a Indias Durante los siglos XVI, XVII y XVIII'''. (Archivo General de Indias, Sevilla.) Seville, Spain: Ministerio de Cultura. Vol. 4 (1560-1566). 1980,
2 CONC  page 560.  ...  Name: '''Juan Farias'''; Year: '''1566'''; Place: '''New Spain''' … [Date of '''application for emigration with intended destination'''. Continuation of nos. 8870-8872, indexed in PILI 1985 and 1989. For further v
2 CONC olumes, see nos. 1623.1-1623.2 above. Extracted from documents in the Archivo General de Indias in Seville.]
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Duaine, Carl.  '''''With All Arms''''', 1987, page 116.  ...  "'''Juan de Farias''', Portuguese, was named as official at Almaden in 1588.  He was an official in Monterrey in 1604.  He may have been the man of the same name with t
2 CONC he Espejo expedition."
2 CONT
2 CONT La Hacienda de San Nicolas de los Berros was initially granted to Alberto del CANTO; later one portion went to Don Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO and another to Don '''Juan de FARIAS'''.
